WEBVTT

01:40.170 --> 01:42.979
[Fangs of Fortune]

01:43.150 --> 01:45.950
[Episode 26]

01:46.890 --> 01:48.190
We've caught the demon.

01:48.190 --> 01:49.009
Shut up!

01:53.590 --> 01:54.450
Where's Zhuo?

01:57.110 --> 01:58.400
Mr. Zhuo...

01:59.560 --> 02:00.760
ran away.

02:07.110 --> 02:07.910
Everyone,

02:08.669 --> 02:12.730
the Chongwu Camp has caught the demon who committed the crime last night.

02:20.900 --> 02:23.920
He is the monster captured by the Chongwu Camp:

02:24.540 --> 02:25.520
Ao Yin.

02:33.800 --> 02:35.230
So he is a demon.

02:35.230 --> 02:36.140
Yeah.

02:37.310 --> 02:38.329
Ao Yin

02:38.540 --> 02:39.940
is best at transforming.

02:39.980 --> 02:42.050
He can transform into anyone.

02:42.160 --> 02:44.620
He was the one who killed the Prime Minister.

02:44.990 --> 02:47.829
We've finally caught him this time.

02:48.380 --> 02:50.760
The Chongwu Camp is impressive.

02:50.780 --> 02:51.579
Yeah.

02:51.710 --> 02:53.840
You have caught such a powerful demon.

02:53.910 --> 02:54.390
Impressive.

02:54.390 --> 02:55.760
We rely on the Chongwu Camp to protect us.

02:55.760 --> 02:57.670
The Demon Hunting Bureau covered for demons.

02:57.670 --> 02:58.470
No.

02:59.270 --> 03:00.290
She is not Ao Yin.

03:05.160 --> 03:06.580
He should be

03:07.010 --> 03:10.670
a demonized human with Ao Yin's capability created by Wen Zongyu.

03:11.080 --> 03:13.170
But why would Wen Zongyu help us?

03:13.390 --> 03:15.930
I guess he wants Mr. Zhuo's Cloud Light Sword.

03:17.070 --> 03:19.130
Otherwise, he won't be able to kill me

03:19.270 --> 03:20.470
or take my inner core.

03:20.750 --> 03:21.590
So,

03:22.350 --> 03:24.410
he can't let anything happen to Zhuo.

04:34.280 --> 04:37.920
♫The spring breeze, she seems to have♫

04:38.010 --> 04:40.260
♫Many stories♫

04:40.510 --> 04:44.860
♫There's a name in her heart♫

04:46.680 --> 04:48.040
♫The human world♫

04:48.090 --> 04:50.409
♫The ink is mottled♫

04:50.470 --> 04:52.650
♫Love, hate, absurdity, mistakes♫

04:52.670 --> 04:54.130
♫Can't clearly write it♫

04:54.370 --> 04:55.520
♫Can't completely express it♫

04:55.590 --> 04:57.810
♫This karma♫

05:38.790 --> 05:41.630
♫The hazy dusk approaches♫

05:42.180 --> 05:44.990
♫The old days are sinking and weighing heavy on my heart♫

05:45.650 --> 05:49.150
♫A great dream covers new clothes♫

05:49.210 --> 05:51.680
♫Sleeping without waking♫

05:52.060 --> 05:55.240
♫Let the spring light hear♫

05:55.900 --> 05:58.790
♫The autumn moon also hears♫

05:58.830 --> 06:01.780
♫Every rainfall♫

06:01.880 --> 06:05.310
♫Is my secret♫

06:05.370 --> 06:08.780
♫I'm afraid to close my eyes♫

06:09.220 --> 06:12.080
♫Yet unwilling to leave♫

06:12.170 --> 06:15.070
♫The wind unsettled♫

06:15.630 --> 06:18.530
♫The waves uncalm♫

06:18.990 --> 06:21.700
♫The dream never ends♫

06:25.580 --> 06:26.780
It sucks.

06:25.850 --> 06:28.450
♫The dream never ends♫

06:27.050 --> 06:27.850
Right?

06:34.720 --> 06:36.210
It's also hard to accept.

06:38.710 --> 06:39.520
Right?

06:49.390 --> 06:51.060
So this is how you felt

06:53.159 --> 06:54.420
when you lost control.

06:55.350 --> 06:57.830
It's like having a very deep dream

06:59.350 --> 07:01.680
and being gripped by fear beyond control.

07:03.750 --> 07:04.590
It's okay.

07:06.050 --> 07:07.180
It's all in the past.

07:10.070 --> 07:11.010
Zhao Yuanzhou.

07:14.950 --> 07:16.430
I understand you now.

07:31.660 --> 07:32.750
Many times,

07:33.490 --> 07:35.350
when I held the Cloud Light Sword,

07:35.650 --> 07:37.500
I asked myself in my heart

07:38.230 --> 07:38.990
if I should

07:40.150 --> 07:41.600
kill you or not.

07:43.760 --> 07:45.250
It seemed each choice

07:46.760 --> 07:48.350
left a part of me

07:48.390 --> 07:50.030
unconvinced.

07:51.580 --> 07:52.610
Only when

07:55.190 --> 07:56.400
I became you

07:59.060 --> 08:00.520
did I finally understand.

08:07.150 --> 08:08.670
I never thought

08:10.570 --> 08:11.590
that one day,

08:13.470 --> 08:14.870
you would become a demon.

08:19.870 --> 08:22.270
You lost control due to the malicious energy

08:22.270 --> 08:24.560
and killed your loved ones.

08:25.610 --> 08:26.650
The shadow

08:26.950 --> 08:28.610
has weighed on you ever since,

08:28.800 --> 08:30.000
with nowhere to hide.

08:31.110 --> 08:31.910
If

08:32.500 --> 08:34.690
I could feel those earlier,

08:35.480 --> 08:38.340
perhaps I would have dropped the Cloud Light Sword.

08:45.590 --> 08:46.750
But now,

08:47.000 --> 08:48.150
the sword is broken.

08:48.490 --> 08:49.350
Maybe

08:49.350 --> 08:51.590
God thinks I'm too stubborn

08:51.750 --> 08:52.950
and hesitant.

08:55.230 --> 08:56.760
So he made a decision for me.

08:58.590 --> 08:59.390
Otherwise,

09:01.010 --> 09:02.170
if I really kill you,

09:03.910 --> 09:05.510
I definitely will regret it.

09:07.550 --> 09:08.630
I can't kill him.

09:10.790 --> 09:12.250
Ying Long's prophecy

09:13.190 --> 09:14.390
seems to be wrong.

09:15.670 --> 09:16.470
No.

09:18.680 --> 09:21.280
Ying Long's prophecies have never been wrong.

09:21.710 --> 09:23.310
Because it's not a prophecy.

09:24.500 --> 09:25.910
It's a curse.

09:33.230 --> 09:34.910
I think I said too much.

09:35.870 --> 09:37.790
I'm not this talkative usually.

09:39.110 --> 09:41.310
I guess it's because of Bingyi's blood.

09:42.350 --> 09:44.610
He must have been a very talkative demon.

09:46.920 --> 09:48.700
Have you ever heard of this?

09:49.670 --> 09:51.270
Humans are naturally humans

09:51.910 --> 09:53.640
because they were born humans.

09:54.070 --> 09:55.270
While demons

09:56.990 --> 09:59.250
need to cultivate hard to become humans.

10:01.080 --> 10:02.530
Monsters are simple,

10:03.430 --> 10:05.360
but instinctively bloodthirsty.

10:06.090 --> 10:07.850
We are more like animals.

10:08.470 --> 10:10.730
They want to hunt when they're hungry.

10:11.870 --> 10:13.360
When they're in danger,

10:13.670 --> 10:14.990
they bare their fangs.

10:16.390 --> 10:18.380
Humans are a type of animal.

10:19.150 --> 10:21.200
But over the course of time,

10:21.630 --> 10:23.500
they have created civilization,

10:24.070 --> 10:25.760
defined good and evil,

10:26.340 --> 10:28.470
and formulated laws and regulations.

10:30.710 --> 10:31.690
So,

10:32.700 --> 10:33.470
humans

10:34.470 --> 10:36.240
are called humans because they

10:36.240 --> 10:37.790
have done many things

10:38.620 --> 10:40.180
that only humans can do.

10:41.190 --> 10:42.270
Just like Bingyi.

10:43.010 --> 10:43.810
So,

10:44.550 --> 10:45.830
do whatever you want

10:46.830 --> 10:48.430
to become what you want to be.

10:51.180 --> 10:52.710
Do whatever you want

10:53.530 --> 10:55.130
to become what you want to be.

10:56.040 --> 10:56.800
Yes.

10:59.150 --> 11:01.350
Why are you suddenly so knowledgeable?

11:03.040 --> 11:04.760
You do know me well.

11:05.560 --> 11:06.800
Actually,

11:07.490 --> 11:09.600
Wen Xiao told me that.

11:10.400 --> 11:11.560
Don't be smug.

11:14.020 --> 11:15.120
So,

11:15.820 --> 11:16.790
even though you've become a demon,

11:16.790 --> 11:17.850
it doesn't matter.

11:19.670 --> 11:21.200
You can still be ambitious,

11:22.690 --> 11:24.260
cherish what you have,

11:24.610 --> 11:25.910
and enjoy your life.

11:27.990 --> 11:29.010
What about you?

11:29.750 --> 11:30.680
What about me?

11:31.340 --> 11:32.600
Do you want to be a demon

11:33.570 --> 11:34.760
or a human?

11:33.830 --> 11:38.570
♫Who misses the youth gazing at the bitter sea♫

11:36.630 --> 11:37.430
I...

11:39.290 --> 11:44.030
♫He shouted and wanted to be heard by the world♫

11:39.920 --> 11:42.040
have never changed.

11:44.480 --> 11:46.120
I've always been

11:45.220 --> 11:47.760
♫The cruel debts of fate♫

11:47.980 --> 11:50.590
♫Are exchanged for the phrase "I'm willing"♫

11:48.430 --> 11:50.580
a great demon seeking death.

11:50.790 --> 11:51.880
♫Wind blows in the distance♫

11:52.220 --> 11:55.810
♫The distant boat approaches the shore♫

11:55.720 --> 11:56.630
Persistent demons

11:56.630 --> 11:57.670
cultivate hard,

11:58.870 --> 12:00.470
hoping they can be immortal.

12:02.440 --> 12:04.340
You really are an anomaly.

12:06.770 --> 12:07.570
Brother.

12:08.640 --> 12:09.950
Have I

12:10.070 --> 12:12.000
turned myself into an anomaly?

12:17.780 --> 12:20.390
It doesn't matter even if I'm considered an anomaly.

12:20.390 --> 12:22.190
Your eyes lie.

12:23.150 --> 12:24.240
But your heart

12:24.550 --> 12:26.120
will tell you the answer.

12:28.090 --> 12:29.810
We will always be with you.

12:31.030 --> 12:32.840
As Ying Lei said,

12:32.970 --> 12:34.470
we formed a family

12:34.910 --> 12:35.710
consisting of

12:36.490 --> 12:37.510
humans,

12:38.590 --> 12:39.390
gods,

12:40.590 --> 12:42.220
demons,

12:42.650 --> 12:44.310
and half-gods, half-demons.

12:45.110 --> 12:46.590
We are family.

12:49.310 --> 12:50.780
Yichen.

12:52.000 --> 12:53.440
Do you know most people

12:53.460 --> 12:55.770
avoid using Chen in their names?

12:55.800 --> 12:56.920
Yes.

12:58.590 --> 13:00.630
Because Chen has a significant meaning.

13:00.630 --> 13:02.560
It symbolizes imperial power.

13:02.910 --> 13:05.260
It's too much for ordinary people.

13:06.070 --> 13:07.630
But Father

13:07.990 --> 13:10.550
insisted on using Chen in your name.

13:11.280 --> 13:12.420
Father said

13:13.110 --> 13:14.410
the meaning of Chen

13:15.150 --> 13:17.640
is actually a roof that shelters all.

13:18.120 --> 13:19.330
With a roof,

13:19.800 --> 13:22.130
people can shelter from the wind and rain.

13:22.550 --> 13:24.110
With a roof,

13:24.870 --> 13:26.150
there is a home.

13:33.270 --> 13:34.810
But Mr. Zhuo,

13:35.470 --> 13:37.590
only you can fulfill my wish.

13:40.630 --> 13:41.650
Please.

13:47.770 --> 13:50.030
I guess I won't be able to keep my promise.

13:50.710 --> 13:51.870
Bingyi's demonic power

13:51.870 --> 13:53.170
is getting stronger.

13:55.200 --> 13:56.600
I may not be able to make it

13:58.070 --> 13:59.830
to fulfill your wish.

14:01.910 --> 14:03.840
Actually, I'm not afraid of death.

14:05.590 --> 14:07.510
I just hope that before I die,

14:08.250 --> 14:10.380
the Cloud Light Sword can be restored.

14:10.830 --> 14:11.720
In this way,

14:12.550 --> 14:14.550
I can at least save Jiu.

14:15.930 --> 14:17.110
After I die,

14:18.230 --> 14:18.970
remember

14:19.030 --> 14:19.670
to take good care of...

14:19.670 --> 14:20.110
Hey.

14:21.280 --> 14:22.300
Stop.

14:23.350 --> 14:25.030
Things like last wishes

14:25.310 --> 14:26.570
are the most annoying.

14:26.660 --> 14:28.920
You haven't reached the end of your life.

14:28.950 --> 14:31.010
You should continue to move forward.

14:31.720 --> 14:33.380
We'll move forward together.

15:30.470 --> 15:31.670
What took you so long?

15:31.990 --> 15:34.100
You two had that much to say?

15:35.440 --> 15:37.380
He asked me to take care of you.

15:37.710 --> 15:40.440
I don't know if that means he wants me to marry you.

15:42.270 --> 15:43.270
Nonsense.

15:46.460 --> 15:47.270
Just kidding.

15:48.070 --> 15:49.150
He didn't say that.

15:51.030 --> 15:53.120
But I know he must think so.

15:53.950 --> 15:55.680
He hopes I can take care of you

15:56.910 --> 15:57.840
and protect you.

15:58.990 --> 16:00.570
Perhaps

16:01.900 --> 16:03.040
you're the only one

16:04.050 --> 16:05.510
he cares about the most

16:07.160 --> 16:08.690
and worries about the most.

16:16.470 --> 16:18.930
Couldn't you two talk about something good?

16:23.070 --> 16:24.080
You

16:24.830 --> 16:27.070
should care about your injury first.

16:34.240 --> 16:35.240
Let me take a look.

17:07.810 --> 17:09.359
Has

17:09.550 --> 17:11.000
no one ever

17:11.380 --> 17:12.910
helped you apply ointment?

17:20.310 --> 17:21.220
I'm a demon.

17:22.470 --> 17:24.440
My wounds can heal immediately.

17:25.810 --> 17:27.270
No need to apply ointment.

17:35.790 --> 17:37.190
Some wounds can't.

17:41.830 --> 17:43.710
You mean the wounds on my back?

17:45.130 --> 17:45.900
No.

17:50.910 --> 17:52.700
The wounds in your heart.

18:19.210 --> 18:20.010
By the way,

18:22.550 --> 18:24.310
it's very dangerous to go

18:25.110 --> 18:26.970
to Bingyi Clan's forbidden area.

18:27.480 --> 18:29.070
So before that,

18:30.710 --> 18:32.830
we need to do something.

18:34.620 --> 18:35.820
I know.

18:36.310 --> 18:38.040
We need to go back to Mount Kunlun

18:38.040 --> 18:39.770
to activate the Star Formation

18:39.950 --> 18:41.550
and restore the Wilderness.

18:42.070 --> 18:43.720
All sources converge.

18:44.020 --> 18:45.820
Yin and Yang reflect each other,

18:46.470 --> 18:48.530
and Heaven and Earth work in harmony.

18:49.670 --> 18:50.510
Unite.

20:10.870 --> 20:11.680
Honey.

20:29.190 --> 20:30.030
Great!

20:30.310 --> 20:31.070
The Kunlun Gate

20:31.070 --> 20:32.600
has finally been restored.

20:39.030 --> 20:39.950
What's wrong?

20:41.350 --> 20:42.300
Nothing.

20:42.710 --> 20:44.990
Let's go to Bingyi Clan's forbidden area now.

20:44.990 --> 20:46.310
Aren't you going to invite us to go

20:46.310 --> 20:48.710
to Bingyi Clan's forbidden area together?

20:58.990 --> 20:59.900
You go first!

20:59.930 --> 21:00.920
I'll stall them!

21:01.520 --> 21:02.350
Ying Lei!

21:02.870 --> 21:04.010
Mr. Zhuo,

21:04.470 --> 21:05.660
it's not that easy

21:05.680 --> 21:06.870
to break Mountain God's barrier!

21:06.870 --> 21:07.670
But you...

21:07.670 --> 21:08.570
I have the Shanhai Portal!

21:08.570 --> 21:09.400
You go first!

21:10.080 --> 21:10.880
Okay.

21:11.230 --> 21:11.760
Let's go!

22:03.540 --> 22:05.290
After passing through this cave,

22:05.290 --> 22:07.690
we'll reach Bingyi Clan's forbidden area:

22:07.870 --> 22:08.830
the Qijuan Cave.

22:13.870 --> 22:14.630
Zhuo!

22:18.710 --> 22:19.950
These are...

22:20.950 --> 22:22.810
monsters' bodies and skeletons.

22:40.420 --> 22:41.680
Why did so many monsters

22:41.680 --> 22:43.910
want to break into Bingyi Clan's forbidden area?

22:43.910 --> 22:45.510
What on earth is in it?

22:46.030 --> 22:48.310
Since so many demons risked their lives to come,

22:48.310 --> 22:50.510
it must be something rare in this world.

22:51.400 --> 22:53.730
There has been a legend in the Wilderness.

22:53.840 --> 22:55.850
It says there is an ancient treasure

22:56.150 --> 22:58.240
in the forbidden area of Bingyi Clan.

22:59.660 --> 23:01.150
An ancient treasure?

23:02.190 --> 23:03.230
Some people say

23:04.160 --> 23:07.090
it's the Holy Ice Spring Water that can prolong life.

23:07.350 --> 23:08.540
Some people say

23:08.990 --> 23:12.430
it's a mysterious herb that can improve cultivation by 1,000 years.

23:12.430 --> 23:14.590
There is another extreme statement.

23:15.920 --> 23:17.980
The treasure hidden inside

23:18.820 --> 23:21.230
can make any of your wishes come true.

23:50.670 --> 23:52.120
Still, they ran away.

23:53.400 --> 23:56.750
Should we continue to go after them to Bingyi Clan's forbidden area?

23:56.750 --> 23:57.550
No need.

23:59.830 --> 24:01.490
Bingyi Clan's forbidden area

24:01.950 --> 24:03.400
is extremely dangerous.

24:04.110 --> 24:05.770
We don't need to take the risk.

24:06.630 --> 24:08.030
What if they really find a way

24:08.030 --> 24:09.890
to restore the Cloud Light Sword?

24:12.030 --> 24:13.230
Do you know

24:13.790 --> 24:15.650
why Bingyi Clan's forbidden area

24:15.830 --> 24:17.070
is so mysterious?

24:21.780 --> 24:23.510
Because in the forbidden area,

24:25.570 --> 24:27.960
there is a monster that has survived

24:28.780 --> 24:31.110
since ancient times.

24:34.540 --> 24:35.340
Wait.

24:37.350 --> 24:38.150
What's wrong?

24:39.960 --> 24:41.290
It's my responsibility

24:41.290 --> 24:43.150
to restore the Cloud Light Sword.

24:43.450 --> 24:44.650
I want to walk the path

24:46.160 --> 24:47.800
on my own from here.

24:49.520 --> 24:50.470
You guys go back.

24:50.470 --> 24:51.080
Nonsense.

24:52.910 --> 24:54.570
Why is it your responsibility

24:55.220 --> 24:57.320
to restore the Cloud Light Sword?

24:58.080 --> 24:59.920
I'm about to die anyway.

25:01.390 --> 25:02.880
I can put up a desperate fight.

25:02.880 --> 25:04.150
I have nothing to fear.

25:05.950 --> 25:07.480
But you guys are different.

25:09.950 --> 25:11.810
You still have so many things to do

25:13.700 --> 25:15.160
in the mortal world.

25:16.350 --> 25:18.070
Mr. Zhuo, don't you think

25:18.640 --> 25:20.560
you're being condescending?

25:22.140 --> 25:23.360
Mr. Zhuo...

25:24.600 --> 25:26.050
is in a dilemma.

25:26.740 --> 25:27.540
Right?

25:33.970 --> 25:35.280
Let's give up

25:40.180 --> 25:42.040
restoring the Cloud Light Sword.

25:50.510 --> 25:51.770
If we can't restore it,

25:52.510 --> 25:53.350
you'll die,

25:53.950 --> 25:55.110
and I'll live.

25:55.910 --> 25:58.180
But everyone in this world will suffer.

25:59.910 --> 26:01.020
If we restore it,

26:01.790 --> 26:02.790
I'll die,

26:03.870 --> 26:05.070
and you'll live.

26:05.940 --> 26:07.940
And everyone in this world can live.

26:08.470 --> 26:09.470
So,

26:10.150 --> 26:12.190
it's better to restore it.

26:18.940 --> 26:20.200
Even if it's restored,

26:22.390 --> 26:23.590
please don't die.

26:29.160 --> 26:30.170
Zhao Yuanzhou,

26:33.700 --> 26:35.250
if you promise me that,

26:38.190 --> 26:39.540
I'll go in with you.

26:53.030 --> 26:54.470
I can't promise you that.

26:57.670 --> 26:59.370
Because my life

27:02.850 --> 27:04.630
is actually in your hands.

27:07.510 --> 27:08.990
I can only promise you

27:10.850 --> 27:12.750
I won't seek death anymore.

27:14.190 --> 27:15.230
Is that okay?

27:21.030 --> 27:21.720
Okay.

27:27.370 --> 27:28.170
Wen Xiao.

27:29.420 --> 27:30.390
Pei Sijing.

27:31.830 --> 27:33.480
Wait for us here.

27:33.810 --> 27:35.190
If we don't come back,

27:36.380 --> 27:38.380
go back to the Demon Hunting Bureau.

27:38.470 --> 27:39.310
Zhuo Yichen!

27:39.330 --> 27:40.070
Wen Xiao.

27:40.070 --> 27:41.160
Call me Aunt!

27:41.630 --> 27:42.390
What?

27:43.870 --> 27:45.270
This matter

27:45.950 --> 27:47.080
is non-negotiable.

27:47.590 --> 27:48.760
Don't talk back.

27:49.830 --> 27:50.590
But I...

27:50.610 --> 27:51.630
What?

27:53.520 --> 27:55.870
Family ties in the mortal world

27:56.290 --> 27:58.990
are scarier than the demonic power in the Wilderness.

27:58.990 --> 27:59.850
You shut up too!

28:15.430 --> 28:17.980
You've known them for quite some time.

28:18.450 --> 28:20.520
It's impossible to get rid of them.

28:23.250 --> 28:24.050
Let's go.

28:24.630 --> 28:26.560
Don't forget what you promised me.

28:37.850 --> 28:39.500
I promised you

28:40.780 --> 28:42.180
a lot of things.

28:45.030 --> 28:46.630
I'll fulfill them one by one.

28:48.040 --> 28:49.970
If I can't fulfill all my promises,

28:52.710 --> 28:54.590
don't blame me, Mr. Zhuo.

29:13.590 --> 29:15.470
Who is here?

29:17.600 --> 29:18.960
Who is asking?

29:19.690 --> 29:20.360
Shut up.

29:21.260 --> 29:22.240
Aren't you ashamed?

29:22.240 --> 29:23.840
Is it necessary to be scared?

29:26.030 --> 29:26.970
No matter how scary he is,

29:26.970 --> 29:28.040
he's still my ancestor.

29:28.040 --> 29:29.500
Would you be afraid when you visit someone's grave?

29:29.500 --> 29:30.450
I'm a great demon.

29:30.450 --> 29:31.480
Why do I need to visit a grave?

29:31.480 --> 29:32.680
Shut up.

29:33.580 --> 29:35.990
It doesn't matter who I am.

29:36.900 --> 29:38.590
But you...

29:39.120 --> 29:41.080
Your eyes

29:41.100 --> 29:43.650
look like his very much.

29:44.910 --> 29:46.780
Bingyi's descendant,

29:46.910 --> 29:49.060
why are you here?

29:51.750 --> 29:53.530
My Cloud Light Sword is broken.

29:53.760 --> 29:56.360
I came here to see if there's a way to restore it.

29:56.470 --> 29:57.330
Oh?

29:59.190 --> 30:00.910
I didn't expect

30:01.030 --> 30:02.710
the Cloud Light Sword

30:02.800 --> 30:05.450
to be broken one day.

30:07.430 --> 30:08.600
The Cloud Light Sword

30:08.600 --> 30:09.880
was broken by me.

30:11.660 --> 30:13.510
I've let my ancestors down.

30:15.530 --> 30:17.330
I specially came here

30:19.170 --> 30:20.600
to ask for help.

30:22.000 --> 30:23.470
Sir, do you know

30:23.860 --> 30:25.890
how to restore it?

30:26.430 --> 30:29.790
The Five-Colored Stone can restore it.

30:30.150 --> 30:31.700
Unfortunately,

30:32.290 --> 30:35.690
you destroyed the Five-Colored Stone too.

30:36.310 --> 30:37.800
How did you know that?

30:37.820 --> 30:40.100
The demon tattoo on his body

30:40.260 --> 30:41.940
means

30:42.000 --> 30:44.040
he has absorbed

30:44.070 --> 30:48.230
Bingyi's blood sealed in the Five-Colored Stone.

30:49.250 --> 30:51.020
This young man

30:51.110 --> 30:54.160
will become a demon soon.

30:54.570 --> 30:55.920
Is there any other way?

30:57.790 --> 30:59.010
Yes.

31:03.480 --> 31:04.920
Please enlighten us.

31:06.030 --> 31:07.790
Of course.

31:07.910 --> 31:09.950
But I have one condition.

31:13.170 --> 31:14.170
What's that?

31:14.670 --> 31:16.700
Since Bingyi left,

31:17.110 --> 31:19.310
I've been all alone.

31:19.630 --> 31:22.590
It's cold and lonely here.

31:22.830 --> 31:25.130
Every minute is like torment.

31:25.870 --> 31:27.430
Bingyi's descendant,

31:27.630 --> 31:29.510
listen carefully.

31:29.550 --> 31:31.620
My condition is

31:31.650 --> 31:35.110
you choose one to accompany me here.

31:35.150 --> 31:36.910
Then I'll tell you

31:37.020 --> 31:40.020
how to restore the Cloud Light Sword.

31:40.740 --> 31:42.120
Accompany you here?

31:43.520 --> 31:45.030
What does that mean?

31:45.990 --> 31:48.390
Since you're Bingyi's descendant,

31:48.790 --> 31:51.680
you must know how to use the freezing technique.

31:52.590 --> 31:55.080
If you freeze one person into ice

31:55.190 --> 31:56.650
and leave that person here

31:56.910 --> 31:58.660
to accompany me forever,

31:59.690 --> 32:03.050
I'll tell you how to restore it.

32:03.290 --> 32:04.550
What do you think?

32:05.510 --> 32:06.840
I'm not going to do that.

32:08.460 --> 32:09.900
I don't want to restore

32:13.060 --> 32:14.370
the Cloud Light Sword.

32:27.680 --> 32:29.680
Then all of them should stay.

32:38.250 --> 32:39.860
Leave one here

32:39.910 --> 32:42.150
or leave three here.

32:42.180 --> 32:43.850
It's up to you.

33:17.610 --> 33:18.450
Ms. Pei.

33:21.960 --> 33:24.250
I've never had a chance

33:25.110 --> 33:26.920
to thank you properly.

33:28.160 --> 33:29.300
Zhuo Yichen,

33:29.550 --> 33:30.880
what are you going to do?

33:31.540 --> 33:32.620
Thank you

33:33.320 --> 33:35.060
for protecting Wen Xiao

33:36.050 --> 33:37.840
and everyone all this time.

33:38.590 --> 33:39.710
No need to thank me.

33:43.640 --> 33:45.040
I didn't protect Wen Xiao

33:46.250 --> 33:47.570
for your sake.

34:35.909 --> 34:37.580
Everything I want to tell you

34:40.679 --> 34:42.170
has been written in it.

34:46.030 --> 34:48.090
You'll understand after reading it.

35:08.150 --> 35:08.910
Do you

35:08.930 --> 35:10.490
still remember

35:11.710 --> 35:12.970
what I told you before?

35:18.870 --> 35:20.880
Those harsh words you said?

35:22.330 --> 35:24.000
I forgot them long ago.

35:26.020 --> 35:27.110
I am

35:27.230 --> 35:28.390
broad-minded

35:30.520 --> 35:31.920
and I don't hold grudges.

35:37.160 --> 35:38.230
Zhao Yuanzhou,

35:39.520 --> 35:41.570
every time you messed around,

35:43.450 --> 35:44.580
I would stare at you.

35:47.350 --> 35:50.350
You would always give in and look like you were scared.

35:51.360 --> 35:52.570
But I know

35:54.880 --> 35:57.120
you've never been afraid of me.

35:59.250 --> 36:01.050
You're not even afraid of death.

36:05.630 --> 36:07.460
Take good care of Wen Xiao for me.

36:11.710 --> 36:13.310
She likes to go on adventures

36:14.340 --> 36:15.520
and cause trouble.

36:17.110 --> 36:18.440
Do your best to stop her.

36:24.230 --> 36:26.190
But she may not listen to me.

36:32.320 --> 36:33.380
She will.

36:48.990 --> 36:49.710
Zhuo.

36:49.710 --> 36:50.440
Zhuo Yichen.

36:51.380 --> 36:52.310
Zhuo!

36:52.640 --> 36:53.390
Zhuo Yichen!

36:53.420 --> 36:54.150
Zhuo Yichen!

36:54.490 --> 36:55.590
What are you going to do?

36:55.590 --> 36:56.430
Zhuo!

37:24.890 --> 37:26.240
Zhuo!

37:55.990 --> 37:57.630
I choose myself.

37:57.990 --> 37:58.750
Zhuo!

38:30.270 --> 38:32.530
After the Cloud Light Sword is restored,

38:32.990 --> 38:35.910
it will find a new master in the mortal world.

38:37.280 --> 38:38.470
Find him

38:40.830 --> 38:42.950
and ask him to save Jiu.

38:45.630 --> 38:46.550
In this way,

38:49.030 --> 38:50.910
I'll have no regrets.

40:13.800 --> 40:15.010
Zhao Yuanzhou.

40:43.230 --> 40:44.350
Zhao Yuanzhou!

40:45.950 --> 40:47.430
Zhao Yuanzhou!

41:40.200 --> 41:41.250
Zhao Yuanzhou!

41:42.060 --> 41:43.250
Get them out of here!

41:44.470 --> 41:45.550
Go away!

41:46.810 --> 41:49.570
I've always wanted to die.

41:50.900 --> 41:52.830
Everyone can be satisfied

41:56.860 --> 41:59.070
if I die here.

42:16.650 --> 42:17.230
Zhao...

42:18.760 --> 42:19.440
Zhao...

42:20.550 --> 42:21.620
Zhao Yuanzhou.

42:23.130 --> 42:24.280
Go.

42:25.400 --> 42:27.330
I'm a 1,000-year-old great demon.

42:28.680 --> 42:32.060
I don't believe I can't break

42:33.080 --> 42:36.530
your ridiculous and heartless ice with all my power

42:39.070 --> 42:43.140
and all the malicious energy in this world.

43:05.600 --> 43:06.490
Break.
